        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a269" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts402" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts403">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>¿Ke:yeh? *Porque** seki tel *más** wehwei, seki tel *más** pisi:ltik,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
